  "description": "The emperor had murdered both of her parents. Since she was about to be claimed, Seo-Hae made up her mind: \"In that filthy golden bed, I will bite off my tongue and die.\"Just as she was being brought into the emperor's chamber, word came that barbarians had invaded the capital. Those beast-like individuals have come to devour this country. The emperor has been replaced, and there came a new era. Even though she had never heard of a red-haired god, to her, the man everyone called beastly is one.",
